{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Semirings\/documentation\/Semirings\/SelectiveSemiring","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/semirings\/selectivesemiring"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SelectiveSemiring"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Semirings\/documentation\/Semirings\/Semiring","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:9Semirings8SemiringP","text":"Semiring"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SL","text":"Comparable"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"a < b"},{"type":"text","text":" exactly when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"a ⊕ b == a"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"a != b"},{"type":"text","text":", read as “a is better than b”. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"a ⊕ b"},{"type":"text","text":" is the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"better of the two, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<"},{"type":"text","text":" is a strict total order, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"zero"},{"type":"text","text":" is the worst element. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<"},{"type":"text","text":" is not the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order of the raw values: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BottleneckSemiring(9) < BottleneckSemiring(2)"},{"type":"text","text":" because wider is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"better, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BooleanSemiring(true) < BooleanSemiring(false)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Dijkstra’s algorithm, Bellman–Ford, DAG shortes